  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 18 of Behind the Scenes. Having packed up the chief editor's office overnight without telling his colleagues, Chun Yuqiao bids a quiet farewell to Xingtian's chairwoman so the company can move forward unburdened. Listen to Chun Yuqiao in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "总编室我已经整理出来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我什么都不带。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "再说了，也不能让同事们知道嘛。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "既然必然要走，那就干脆一点。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我不过是故作潇洒而已。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "太为难的事，就别勉强了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "星天还要轻装上阵呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我们一定会证明的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "只是我真的是没想到。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没想到我会这样离开星天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这次又给你添麻烦了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你命好，不会有我这么糟心的弟弟的。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
