    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "总编室我已经整理出来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have already cleared out the chief editor office.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我什么都不带。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am taking nothing at all with me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "再说了，也不能让同事们知道嘛。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Besides, we cannot let our colleagues find out either.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "既然必然要走，那就干脆一点。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Since leaving is inevitable, it is better to make a clean break.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我不过是故作潇洒而已。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am merely putting on a carefree front.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "太为难的事，就别勉强了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When something is too difficult, there is no need to force it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "星天还要轻装上阵呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian still needs to march forward travelling light.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我们一定会证明的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We will definitely prove it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "只是我真的是没想到。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I just truly never expected this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没想到我会这样离开星天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I never imagined I would leave Xingtian in this way.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这次又给你添麻烦了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have caused trouble for you once again.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你命好，不会有我这么糟心的弟弟的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are fortunate enough never to have a worrisome younger brother like me.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
